### ============================================================
### AiExtractionService(/pets/extract-features)の動作確認用
### 事前準備：
### 1. 別ターミナルでAIサーバーを起動しておくこと
###    uvicorn match_api:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
### 2. このファイルと同じ階層に test-assets/test.jpg があることを確認
### ============================================================

### ①owner権限でログイン(finder/shelterでもOK、役割チェックは特に無いエンドポイントのため)
# @name ownerLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/test-login?role=owner

###

### ②正常系：写真1枚を送って特徴抽出(200 OKで解析結果が返るはず)
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/extract-features
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-assets/test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### ③正常系：写真を2枚まとめて送る(同じ1匹を別角度から撮った想定、200 OKで統合された結果が返るはず)
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/extract-features
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="test1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-assets/test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="test2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-assets/test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### ④異常系：写真を1枚も付けずに送る(400 Bad Requestが返るはず)
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/extract-features
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary--

###

### ⑤異常系：トークン無しで送る(401 Unauthorizedが返るはず)
POST http://localhost:8080/pets/extract-features
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-assets/test.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--